{"id":"e05ae99926179fce","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex.md","title":"局部抽象域与结果类型不同的归约","display":"ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex — 局部抽象域与结果类型不同的归约","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex","aliases":["72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex"],"display":"ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex — 局部抽象域与结果类型不同的归约","depends_on":["[[72-df-curry-howard]]","[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §3.1.5 print68–69/PDF80–81; Ch.X §3.11 print751–752/PDF763–764; local typed beta/eta examples","source_kind":"source-guided-local-regression-example","verification_status":"local-typing-and-generator-membership-proved-in-note; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"explicit finite typing and substitution calculation","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-23"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex — 局部抽象域与结果类型不同的归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §3.1.5 print68–69/PDF80–81; Ch.X §3.11 print751–752/PDF763–764; local typed beta/eta examples"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-guided-local-regression-example"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-typing-and-generator-membership-proved-in-note; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"explicit finite typing and substitution calculation"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-23"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\in\\mathsf B\">\\(o\\in\\mathsf B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,f,h\\in V_t\">\\(x,y,f,h\\in V_t\\)</span> 两两互异。类型、项和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_\\to\">\\(\\vdash_\\to\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38d92d6727e7ead\" href=\"?note=e38d92d6727e7ead\" title=\"72-df-simply-typed-lambda\">72-df-simply-typed-lambda</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,\\operatorname{CH},\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A}\">\\(J,\\operatorname{CH},\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4628a763a7cdff3f\" href=\"?note=4628a763a7cdff3f\" title=\"72-df-curry-howard\">72-df-curry-howard</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下式所有项和证明均按相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 类读取；两个局部抽象域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span> 分别独立于外部结果类型。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\beta,\\Gamma_\\eta\">\\(\\Gamma_\\beta,\\Gamma_\\eta\\)</span> 是有限函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_\\lambda\">\\(\\beta_\\lambda\\)</span> 为既有兼容项归约。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B:=o\\to o,\\qquad C:=B\\to o,\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\beta:=\\{\\langle x,o\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\eta:=\\{\\langle h,C\\rangle\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B:=o\\to o,\\qquad C:=B\\to o,\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\beta:=\\{\\langle x,o\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\eta:=\\{\\langle h,C\\rangle\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_0&amp;:=(\\lambda f:B.fx)(\\lambda y:o.y),&amp;M_1&amp;:=(\\lambda y:o.y)x,&amp;M_2&amp;:=x,\\\\\nN_0&amp;:=\\lambda f:B.hf,&amp;N_1&amp;:=h,\\\\\nd_j&amp;:=J(M_j),&amp;e_i&amp;:=J(N_i)\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_0&amp;:=(\\lambda f:B.fx)(\\lambda y:o.y),&amp;M_1&amp;:=(\\lambda y:o.y)x,&amp;M_2&amp;:=x,\\\\\nN_0&amp;:=\\lambda f:B.hf,&amp;N_1&amp;:=h,\\\\\nd_j&amp;:=J(M_j),&amp;e_i&amp;:=J(N_i)\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall j&lt;3\\quad\\Gamma_\\beta\\vdash_\\to M_j:o,\\qquad\n\\forall i&lt;2\\quad\\Gamma_\\eta\\vdash_\\to N_i:C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall j&lt;3\\quad\\Gamma_\\beta\\vdash_\\to M_j:o,\\qquad\n\\forall i&lt;2\\quad\\Gamma_\\eta\\vdash_\\to N_i:C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle M_0,M_1\\rangle,\\langle M_1,M_2\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda,\\qquad\n\\langle d_0,d_1\\rangle,\\langle d_1,d_2\\rangle\\in\\delta_{\\to,\\Gamma_\\beta,o}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle M_0,M_1\\rangle,\\langle M_1,M_2\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda,\\qquad\n\\langle d_0,d_1\\rangle,\\langle d_1,d_2\\rangle\\in\\delta_{\\to,\\Gamma_\\beta,o}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle e_0,e_1\\rangle\\in\\epsilon_{\\to,\\Gamma_\\eta,C},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CH}(d_j)=M_j\\quad(j&lt;3),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CH}(e_i)=N_i\\quad(i&lt;2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle e_0,e_1\\rangle\\in\\epsilon_{\\to,\\Gamma_\\eta,C},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CH}(d_j)=M_j\\quad(j&lt;3),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CH}(e_i)=N_i\\quad(i&lt;2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 I§3.1.5 允许任意域类型与余域类型的抽象，X§3.11 要求对象归约对应证明归约。本例是该机制的本地具体实例，书中没有同编号例子。</p>\n<p>在 Γβ,f:B 中，由 f:B 与 x:o 得 fx:o；抽象后得 B→o。恒等项 λy:o.y 的类型为 B，所以 M₀:o。代入该恒等项给 M₁，再作基类型 β 收缩给 x。J 将这两步分别写成域类型为 B、o 的消除紧接引入归约。η 例中 h:C，在 Γη,f:B 中 hf:o，故 λf:B.hf:C；f 不在 h 的自由变量中，η 生成元直接给 e₀→e₁。</p>\n<p>旧式把外部结果类型 o、C 同时当作局部域类型，因而不能直接登记这两个混合类型生成步。这里展示缺失的生成元及修复后的精确成员关系，不声称仅凭一个缺失的直接步已经证明旧等价闭包中两对象不等价。验证是有限推导与替换计算，不是一般正规化或外部文献全证核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-curry-howard]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-simply-typed-lambda","status":"resolved","id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$o\\in\\mathsf B$；$x,y,f,h\\in V_t$ 两两互异。类型、项和 $\\vdash_\\to$ 取 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]；$J,\\operatorname{CH},\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A}$ 取 [[72-df-curry-howard]]。$j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-curry-howard","status":"resolved","id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$o\\in\\mathsf B$；$x,y,f,h\\in V_t$ 两两互异。类型、项和 $\\vdash_\\to$ 取 [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]]；$J,\\operatorname{CH},\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A}$ 取 [[72-df-curry-howard]]。$j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"o\\in\\mathsf B","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,f,h\\in V_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_\\to","display":false},{"tex":"J,\\operatorname{CH},\\delta_{s,\\Gamma,A},\\epsilon_{s,\\Gamma,A}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\beta,\\Gamma_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"B:=o\\to o,\\qquad C:=B\\to o,\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\beta:=\\{\\langle x,o\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\Gamma_\\eta:=\\{\\langle h,C\\rangle\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_0&:=(\\lambda f:B.fx)(\\lambda y:o.y),&M_1&:=(\\lambda y:o.y)x,&M_2&:=x,\\\\\nN_0&:=\\lambda f:B.hf,&N_1&:=h,\\\\\nd_j&:=J(M_j),&e_i&:=J(N_i)\\quad(i\\in\\{0,1\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall j<3\\quad\\Gamma_\\beta\\vdash_\\to M_j:o,\\qquad\n\\forall i<2\\quad\\Gamma_\\eta\\vdash_\\to N_i:C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle M_0,M_1\\rangle,\\langle M_1,M_2\\rangle\\in\\beta_\\lambda,\\qquad\n\\langle d_0,d_1\\rangle,\\langle d_1,d_2\\rangle\\in\\delta_{\\to,\\Gamma_\\beta,o}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle e_0,e_1\\rangle\\in\\epsilon_{\\to,\\Gamma_\\eta,C},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CH}(d_j)=M_j\\quad(j<3),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{CH}(e_i)=N_i\\quad(i<2).","display":true}],"bytes":3030,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"4628a763a7cdff3f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-23补充审修：原最后几式已固定结果类型A，却仍用A标注每个局部抽象，使局部β/η域类型被意外限制。现以独立的B给出全部合法局部抽象；例如结果为基类型而绑定函数类型的β步也被登记。每个生成对的两端保持同一外部判断；这项修订不把不同上下文或不同结果类型的证明混成同一商。混合类型实例见 [[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]，该链接是后续例子，不是定义前提。"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本轮修订：[[72-df-curry-howard]] · [[72-thm-curry-howard-isomorphism]] · [[72-df-simply-typed-lambda]] · [[72-df-system-f]]；新增：[[72-ex-curry-howard-mixed-type-redex]]。"}],"outgoing":["4628a763a7cdff3f","e38d92d6727e7ead"]}